                "text": "Arc omits the EIP-4788 beacon-roots contract, so calls to 0x000F3df6D732807Ef1319fB7B8bB8522d0Beac02 return empty data. Anything that treats it as an oracle or a randomness source gets nothing back."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Drop the beacon-roots dependency. The EIP-2935 block-hash history contract is deployed on Arc if you need past block hashes.\\n\\nSource: https://docs.arc.io/arc/references/evm-differences#execution-and-opcode-differences"
